<title>GERMANY: Rabobank offers to buy out German minority holders.</title>
<headline>Rabobank offers to buy out German minority holders.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rabobank International Holding BV of the Netherlands said on Friday it was offering to buy out remaining minority shareholders in its 96.5 percent-owned German unit Rabobank Deutschland AG.</p>
<p>Rabobank said it would offer 115 marks each for the shares, which last traded in Frankfurt at 105 marks.</p>
<p>-- Kevin Liffey, Bonn newsroom +49-228-26097160</p>
